g_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArdaE/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArdaE/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArdaE/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArdaE/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArdaE/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArdaE/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArdaE/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArdaE/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120040#pullrequestreview-4441623170","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120040","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120040#pullrequestreview-4441623170"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120040"}},"submitted_at":"2026-06-06T04:22:31Z","commit_id":"3c9a92fcfe489feeb4fa60486af156f4f81ee18c"},{"id":4443386940,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNi0PA","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?u=24618295fece29a0bf5c850faf2555985232f5f2&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I support this feature, and the code looks good to me. I did not test it.\n\nIt makes a lot of sense to import data that is semantically \"here is my custom data\" rather than shoe-horning custom data into further \"TEXCOORD_\\*\" attributes. It's good to keep supporting \"TEXCOORD_\\*\" forever so that Godot doesn't lose data from arbitrary glTF files where that data exists, but \"_CUSTOM\\*\" as a more direct option should take priority when it exists. The name \"_CUSTOM\\*\" is arbitrary and not in the glTF spec, but anything else would be equally arbitrary, and I think \"_CUSTOM\\*\" is a generic enough name (not Godot-centric) that it's not at all unreasonable to see other places or assets adopt this style for arbitrary user-choice custom vertex attribute data.\n\nThis PR directly overlaps with this other PR #97756 which allows custom vertex attributes to be imported in a custom way. PR #97756 is still a work-in-progress and still being discussed, but even aside from that, I think this PR is good to merge first, it's a simple improvement and a good default. The author of PR #97756 (@huwpascoe) will have to rebase their PR on top of this.\n\nFor other people wanting to review, I find the diff on GitHub to be particularly bad to read for this PR, so here's a screenshot of GitKraken:\n\n<img width=\"1830\" height=\"1557\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd9aca50-a760-44e1-b227-9e41bb41afd5\" />","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120040#pullrequestreview-4443386940","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120040","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120040#pullrequestreview-4443386940"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120040"}},"submitted_at":"2026-06-06T16:53:47Z","commit_id":"2f02792721562c87ad4bdefdfdcbf9d94593131b"}]